---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="MealMate - AI Meal Planning App - Ryan Darius Lim">
    <div class="ux-projects" style="padding-top: 80px;">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-header">
                    <div class="project-title-row">
                        <h3 class="project-title">🍽️ MealMate</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="project-role">Full-Stack Developer + Product and UI/UX Designer</p>
                    <p class="project-dates">2024 – Present</p>
                </div>

                <div class="project-content">
                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Project Overview</h4>
                        <p>
                            MealMate is an intelligent web application designed to revolutionise the way users plan, cook, and manage their meals. 
                            By combining AI-driven recipe generation, real-time inventory tracking, and nutritional insights, MealMate transforms 
                            the often-stressful question of "What should I cook today?" into a simple, engaging, and personalised experience.
                        </p>
                        <div style="margin: 20px 0;">
                            <a href="https://mealmate-9a71a.web.app/" target="_blank" 
                               style="display: inline-block; background: #0366d6; color: white; padding: 12px 28px; 
                                      border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.05rem; 
                                      transition: background 0.2s;">
                                🚀 Launch MealMate App
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Add screenshots -->
                    <div class="project-image">
                        <img src="/MealMate-landing.png" alt="MealMate landing page">
                    </div>
                    <p style="margin: 10px 0; color: #586069;">
                        MealMate landing page, allowing users to create a new account or login using Email+Password or Google Authentication.
                    </p>

                    <br>
                    <div class="project-image">
                        <img src="/MealMate-tracking.png" alt="MealMate dashboard showing inventory tracking">
                    </div>
                    <p style="margin: 10px 0; color: #586069;">
                        MealMate dashboard showing inventory tracking, split into nutritional balance and inventory quantities.
                    </p>

                    <br>

                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Key Features</h4>
                        
                        <div class="feature-grid">
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">🤖 AI Recipe Generation</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Intelligent recipe suggestions based on available pantry ingredients, dietary preferences, 
                                    and user meal history for truly personalized recommendations.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">📦 Real-Time Inventory</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Users can log ingredients in their pantry and receive automatic updates on ingredient 
                                    usage, eliminating food waste and simplifying shopping.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">🎯 Personalized Learning</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Algorithm learns from liked and disliked meals to provide increasingly accurate 
                                    and tailored suggestions over time.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">📊 Nutrition Dashboard</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Interactive visualizations showing nutritional balance and ingredient usage patterns 
                                    to promote healthier eating habits.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">🍳 Smart Meal Planning</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Transform the daily question "What should I cook?" into a seamless, stress-free 
                                    experience with intelligent planning.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">🔐 Secure Authentication</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Multiple authentication options including email/password and Google OAuth for 
                                    secure, convenient access.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Technical Architecture -->
                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Technical Implementation</h4>
                        
                        <div class="feature-grid">
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Frontend Framework</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Built with Vue.js for reactive, component-based user interface with smooth, 
                                    responsive interactions across all devices.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Backend & Database</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Firebase provides real-time database synchronization, secure user authentication, 
                                    and reliable data storage with automatic scaling.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">AI Integration</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    We integrated Gemini-2.0-Flash-Lite's recommendation model into a fully designed user flow, 
                                    creating a smooth, responsive experience with continuous learning from user feedback.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Data Visualization</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Interactive charts and dashboards built for nutritional tracking and inventory 
                                    management with real-time updates.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">State Management</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Vuex for centralized state management, ensuring consistent data flow and 
                                    seamless synchronization across components.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Responsive Design</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Mobile-first approach with fluid layouts and touch-optimized interactions 
                                    for perfect experience on any device.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- UX Design Philosophy -->
                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">UX Design Philosophy</h4>
                        
                        <p>
                            In designing the UI and UX for MealMate, my guiding principle was to make the entire experience feel effortless 
                            and intuitive, something users could engage with in just a few taps. We wanted the interaction flow to feel as 
                            natural as chatting with an AI assistant, so we intentionally modelled parts of the interface after familiar 
                            generative-AI chat applications like ChatGPT.
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top: 15px;">
                            By prioritizing simplicity, conversational UX, and minimal friction, we intended for users to focus on cooking, 
                            not on learning how to use the app.
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;"><strong>Key UX Decisions:</strong></p>
                        <ul class="simple-list">
                            <li><strong>Conversational Interface:</strong> Chat-like interaction pattern for recipe generation feels natural and familiar to users already comfortable with AI assistants</li>
                            <li><strong>Progressive Disclosure:</strong> Advanced features hidden initially, revealed as users become more comfortable with the app</li>
                            <li><strong>Immediate Feedback:</strong> Real-time updates and animations provide constant feedback, making the app feel responsive and alive</li>
                            <li><strong>Visual Hierarchy:</strong> Clear distinction between primary actions (generate recipe) and secondary functions (view inventory)</li>
                            <li><strong>Minimal Cognitive Load:</strong> Simple, focused screens that don't overwhelm users with too many options at once</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Product Development Process -->
                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Product Development Process</h4>
                        
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Problem Identification:</strong></p>
                        <p>
                            Daily meal planning is a common pain point - people waste time deciding what to cook, 
                            often forget what ingredients they have, and struggle to maintain nutritional balance. 
                            Existing solutions were either too complex or didn't integrate inventory management.
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Solution Design:</strong></p>
                        <ul class="simple-list">
                            <li>Wireframed user flows from login to recipe generation to cooking</li>
                            <li>Created low-fidelity prototypes to test core interactions</li>
                            <li>Iterated on UI based on testing with 10+ early users</li>
                            <li>Designed component library for consistent visual language</li>
                        </ul>

                        <p style="margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Development Approach:</strong></p>
                        <ul class="simple-list">
                            <li>Built MVP with core features: auth, inventory, basic recipe generation</li>
                            <li>Integrated Gemini AI for intelligent recipe recommendations</li>
                            <li>Added data visualization for nutritional tracking</li>
                            <li>Implemented user feedback loop for continuous improvement</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Technical Challenges -->
                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Technical Challenges & Solutions</h4>
                        
                        <div class="feature-grid">
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Real-Time Sync</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Challenge: Keeping inventory counts synchronized across recipe generation and manual updates. 
                                    Solution: Firebase real-time listeners with optimistic UI updates.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">AI Response Quality</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Challenge: Ensuring AI generates practical, cookable recipes with available ingredients. 
                                    Solution: Carefully crafted prompts with constraints and validation logic.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Performance Optimization</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Challenge: Large ingredient databases slowing down app. 
                                    Solution: Lazy loading, pagination, and Firebase query optimization.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">User Onboarding</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Challenge: Getting users to populate initial inventory. 
                                    Solution: Optional quick-start with common ingredients and guided first recipe.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Product Impact & Future Vision</h4>
                        
                        <p>
                            MealMate addresses a universal pain point in daily life—meal planning and inventory management. 
                            By leveraging AI and real-time data, the application reduces food waste, simplifies cooking decisions, 
                            and promotes healthier eating habits through nutritional awareness. The personalized approach ensures 
                            that each user receives recommendations tailored to their unique preferences and available ingredients.
                        </p>

                        <p style="margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;"><strong>Future Enhancements:</strong></p>
                        <ul class="simple-list">
                            <li><strong>Meal Planning Calendar:</strong> Weekly meal prep suggestions based on schedule and ingredients</li>
                            <li><strong>Shopping List Generation:</strong> Automatic grocery lists from planned recipes</li>
                            <li><strong>Recipe Sharing:</strong> Community features for users to share and discover recipes</li>
                            <li><strong>Dietary Goal Tracking:</strong> Advanced nutrition analytics and goal setting</li>
                            <li><strong>Voice Interface:</strong> Hands-free cooking assistance while in the kitchen</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="tools">
                        <span class="tool-tag">Vue.js</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">Firebase</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">JavaScript</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">HTML/CSS</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">Gemini AI</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">Vuex</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">Data Visualization</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">Real-Time Database</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">UI/UX Design</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">Product Management</span>
                    </div>

                    <div style="margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 30px; border-top: 2px solid #e1e4e8;">
                        <a href="/projects" style="color: #0366d6; font-weight: 600;">← Back to All Projects</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
